# Supabase Multitenant

- Every business row carries `tenant_id` (uuid FK → `tenants`).
- RLS: members only see their tenants; service role reserved for Telegram webhook + indexer.
- Helpers: `is_tenant_member(tenant_id)`, `has_tenant_role(tenant_id, role)`.
- No cross-tenant portal codes without membership checks.
- Migrations are additive; never weaken RLS for convenience.
